# Ornith-Featherweight SINGLE-USER serving config — measured 18.93 t/s in the web UI on
# 2x RTX 4090 (24 GB) + 90 GB DDR5 + Gen5 NVMe, page cache warm (2026-07-05).
# This is the llamafile sidecar's embedded default. For multi-user/eval serving append:
#   -c 163840 -np 4 --n-cpu-moe 50 -ts 50,10
# Speed physics: 104 GB of experts vs ~85 GB page cache => speed follows cache warmth.
# First generations after a cold start run ~8-9 t/s and climb; warm steady-state 15-19 t/s.
# Pre-warm trick: dd if=<gguf> of=/dev/null bs=64M   (seconds on NVMe, doubles first-response speed)
-ngl 99
--n-cpu-moe 49
-ts 52,8
-b 8192
-ub 8192
-fa on
--cache-type-k q8_0
--cache-type-v q8_0
-c 65536
-np 1
--jinja
--reasoning-format auto
--reasoning-budget 1024
